cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these reports, please cite them using the metadata in this file, and cite ctddump and the Copernicus Marine products they summarise (see references)."
type: dataset
title: "ctddump example report site: summary reports of Copernicus Marine CTD profiles"
abstract: >-
  A static web site of summary reports, one page per region and product, for
  the CTD (Conductivity, Temperature, Depth) profiles of the Copernicus Marine
  in-situ NRT and CORA products in the Arctic, Baltic and Mediterranean seas.
  Each page follows the ctddump pipeline: source file coverage, conversion and
  data mode, pressure order, cleaning, de-duplication, and comparison with the
  other products of the region. Generated with ctddump's summary_site.sh; a
  point-in-time snapshot of the data at the date of each release.
authors:
  - family-names: "Saito"
    given-names: "Takaya"
repository: "https://github.com/AIQC-Hub/ctddump-report-example"
